  "description": "It takes so little to become a target. Hojin only did what he had to do—help out a friend in need. He was trying to save his friend from Jung-Yoon, the school’s aggressive bully. Back then, he didn't know that doing the right thing can sometimes lead you to hell. Now the target of vicious bullying, Hojin's desperate to get back to normalcy. He’s had enough. Something inside his soul has broken. He can’t let this carry on. Small ripples of rebellion are forming inside him, and these ripples will soon turn into a tidal wave, a tidal wave that will wipe everything away.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
